H('247.d.5.D',4,"According to Expectancy Theory, an employee will work harder when:","They believe effort will be rewarded",["Rewards are random","Goals are impossible","Rewards are unwanted"],"Expectancy links effort to reward.")
H('247.d.5.E',3,"Clear goals and fair rewards usually make employees:","More motivated",["Less engaged","Less productive","Unclear"],"Goals and rewards motivate.")
