H('247.d.5.J',4,"A leader managing a team of highly skilled experts may choose a:","Laissez-faire style that allows independence",["Strict control","No leadership","Autocratic order"],"Experts need freedom.")
H('247.d.5.K',3,"Sending a message, the receiver decoding it, and feedback make up the:","Communication process",["Production line","Payroll cycle","Hiring plan"],"Communication has sender, message, receiver, and feedback.")
