H('247.d.7.A',4,"Recognizing your own biases helps you:","Make fairer decisions",["Hide mistakes","Judge others faster","Avoid change"],"Awareness reduces bias.")
H('247.d.7.B',3,"Listening before responding to a coworker's concern is an effective:","Interpersonal skill",["Delay tactic","Competition","Accounting rule"],"Good interpersonal skills include listening.")
